pigs-from-samoas-nuutele-island-by-october-2026-sea-turtles-were-nesting-after-decades-of-absence-ground-doves-were-breeding-and-native-seedlings-had-returned/articleshow/135218009.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-2025-teams-began-clearing-invasive-rats-and-feral-pigs-from-samoas-nuutele-island-by-october-2026-sea-turtles-were-nesting-after-decades-of-absence-ground-doves-were-breeding-and-native-seedlings-had-returned/articleshow/135218009.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T01:24:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135219269,imgsize-1680856.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[H-1B visa holder from India arrested in Ohio on child pornography charges; faces 10 years in prison if convicted]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135219072.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/h-1b-visa-holder-from-india-arrested-in-ohio-on-child-pornography-charges-faces-10-years-in-prison-if-convicted/articleshow/135219072.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/h-1b-visa-holder-from-india-arrested-in-ohio-on-child-pornography-charges-faces-10-years-in-prison-if-convicted/articleshow/135219072.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T00:58:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135219099,imgsize-34586.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[JD Vance lost his temper as Elon Musk, Jensen Huang extended their AI chat, reportedly used 'F' word; his team says never happened, complete fabrication]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margi